## Node.js Text-to-Image Code Example

For a basic text-to-image generation with Node.js, you can use the GoogleGenAI SDK to create a picture of a nano banana dish in a fancy restaurant with a Gemini theme using the `gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview` model, iterating over response parts to extract text and image data.

Here's the structure from the official docs:

```javascript
import { GoogleGenAI } from "@google/genai";
import * as fs from "node:fs";

async function main() {
  const ai = new GoogleGenAI({});
  const prompt = "Create a picture of a nano banana dish in a fancy restaurant with a Gemini theme";

  const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
    model: "gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview",
    contents: prompt,
  });

